{
 "id": "seg5",
 "title": "三层钱包",
 "pill": 5,
 "total": 93.32,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg5-00",
   "text": "交易所每天都要给用户提币，不能每一笔都等人工签名。",
   "spoken": "交易所每天都要给用户提币，不能每一笔都等人工签名。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg5-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 6.27
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-01",
   "text": "常见做法，是分成热、温、冷三层钱包。",
   "spoken": "常见做法，是分成热、温、冷三层钱包。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg5-01.wav",
   "start": 6.7,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 6.798,
   "speechEnd": 11.16
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-02",
   "text": "冷钱包放大部分资产，用多签或 MPC，每个签名人用硬件钱包。",
   "spoken": "冷钱包放大部分资产，用多签或 MPC，每个签名人用硬件钱包。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg5-02.wav",
   "start": 11.56,
   "dur": 6.48,
   "speechStart": 11.659,
   "speechEnd": 17.819
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-03",
   "text": "温钱包负责中转，靠审批加时间窗口。",
   "spoken": "温钱包负责中转，靠审批加时间窗口。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg5-03.wav",
   "start": 18.26,
   "dur": 3.84,
   "speechStart": 18.26,
   "speechEnd": 21.887
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-04",
   "text": "热钱包自动给用户提币，用 HSM 或 MPC。",
   "spoken": "热钱包自动给用户提币，用 HSM 或 MPC。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg5-04.wav",
   "start": 22.32,
   "dur": 4.16,
   "speechStart": 22.32,
   "speechEnd": 26.301
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-05",
   "text": "热钱包只放一小部分，按每天的提币需求设水位。",
   "spoken": "热钱包只放一小部分，按每天的提币需求设水位。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg5-05.wav",
   "start": 26.7,
   "dur": 4.24,
   "speechStart": 26.795,
   "speechEnd": 30.774
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-06",
   "text": "热钱包失守，损失有上限。",
   "spoken": "热钱包失守，损失有上限。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg5-06.wav",
   "start": 31.16,
   "dur": 2.88,
   "speechStart": 31.253,
   "speechEnd": 33.8
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-07",
   "text": "冷到温，温到热，每一跳都要限额和审批。",
   "spoken": "冷到温，温到热，每一跳都要限额和审批。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg5-07.wav",
   "start": 34.26,
   "dur": 5.12,
   "speechStart": 34.26,
   "speechEnd": 39.121
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-08",
   "text": "再猜一道题。",
   "spoken": "再猜一道题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg5-08.wav",
   "start": 39.6,
   "dur": 0.96,
   "speechStart": 39.6,
   "speechEnd": 40.363
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-09",
   "text": "HSM 的私钥不能导出。",
   "spoken": "HSM 的私钥不能导出。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg5-09.wav",
   "start": 40.78,
   "dur": 2.4,
   "speechStart": 40.873,
   "speechEnd": 43.053
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-10",
   "text": "攻击者控制了能给 HSM 发指令的服务器，HSM 会拒绝吗？",
   "spoken": "攻击者控制了能给 HSM 发指令的服务器，HSM 会拒绝吗？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg5-10.wav",
   "start": 43.4,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 43.491,
   "speechEnd": 48.443
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-11",
   "text": "不会。",
   "spoken": "不会。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg5-11.wav",
   "start": 49.18,
   "dur": 0.56,
   "speechStart": 49.275,
   "speechEnd": 49.559
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-12",
   "text": "HSM 只保证私钥不出设备，它按收到的指令签名。",
   "spoken": "HSM 只保证私钥不出设备，它按收到的指令签名。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg5-12.wav",
   "start": 49.96,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 50.06,
   "speechEnd": 55.16
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-13",
   "text": "所以热钱包的安全，在签名请求进入 HSM 之前。",
   "spoken": "所以热钱包的安全，在签名请求进入 HSM 之前。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg5-13.wav",
   "start": 55.62,
   "dur": 5.12,
   "speechStart": 55.711,
   "speechEnd": 60.578
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-14",
   "text": "那里要有一个独立的风控引擎，检查白名单、限额、速率和异常。",
   "spoken": "那里要有一个独立的风控引擎，检查白名单、限额、速率和异常。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg5-14.wav",
   "start": 60.96,
   "dur": 6.24,
   "speechStart": 61.056,
   "speechEnd": 67.031
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-15",
   "text": "检查要按待签的原始字节判断，不看界面怎么写。",
   "spoken": "检查要按待签的原始字节判断，不看界面怎么写。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg5-15.wav",
   "start": 67.42,
   "dur": 3.92,
   "speechStart": 67.42,
   "speechEnd": 71.147
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-16",
   "text": "一笔大额转出，审批也要按顺序走。",
   "spoken": "一笔大额转出，审批也要按顺序走。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg5-16.wav",
   "start": 71.56,
   "dur": 3.28,
   "speechStart": 71.654,
   "speechEnd": 74.612
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-17",
   "text": "发起人提交交易，写明用途。",
   "spoken": "发起人提交交易，写明用途。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg5-17.wav",
   "start": 75.06,
   "dur": 2.64,
   "speechStart": 75.06,
   "speechEnd": 77.528
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-18",
   "text": "系统自动检查白名单、限额，以及操作类型是不是 CALL。",
   "spoken": "系统自动检查白名单、限额，以及操作类型是不是 CALL。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg5-18.wav",
   "start": 77.92,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 77.92,
   "speechEnd": 82.25
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-19",
   "text": "签名人各自解码核对，大额再用电话或当面确认。",
   "spoken": "签名人各自解码核对，大额再用电话或当面确认。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg5-19.wav",
   "start": 82.7,
   "dur": 4.72,
   "speechStart": 82.7,
   "speechEnd": 87.232
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-20",
   "text": "执行之后，监控系统把链上结果和审批记录比对。",
   "spoken": "执行之后，监控系统把链上结果和审批记录比对。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg5-20.wav",
   "start": 87.64,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speechStart": 87.735,
   "speechEnd": 91.934
  }
 ],
